{"ID":"20240830110031-5ecpujj","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240830110031-5ecpujj","title":"青麸杨（青肤杨）","type":"doc","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240830110125-wcuy4sh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830110125-wcuy4sh","updated":"20240830110125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 767px;","style":"width: 757px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"青麸杨 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/青麸杨 6-20240830104942-o1zk7cp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 757px;\" parent-style=\"width: 767px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 393px;","style":"width: 383px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"青麸杨 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/青麸杨 4-20240830104838-bq87idv.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 383px;\" parent-style=\"width: 393px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240830110133-l8juli3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830110133-l8juli3","updated":"20240830110140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 590px;","style":"width: 580px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"青麸杨 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/青麸杨 5-20240830104857-ynig9l7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 580px;\" parent-style=\"width: 590px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 590px;","style":"width: 580px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"青麸杨 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/青麸杨 3-20240830104809-edw35bk.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 580px;\" parent-style=\"width: 590px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240830114341-4kv8rmo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114341-4kv8rmo","updated":"20240830114439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 410px;","style":"width: 400px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"青麸杨 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/青麸杨 9-20240830114341-lwjlmwe.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 400px;\" parent-style=\"width: 410px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 410px;","style":"width: 400px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"青麸杨 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/青麸杨 10-20240830114433-uymi02c.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 400px;\" parent-style=\"width: 410px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 481px;","style":"width: 471px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"青麸杨 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/青麸杨 8-20240830113526-sj3m1ci.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 471px;\" parent-style=\"width: 481px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240830114540-o2hjutf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114540-o2hjutf","updated":"20240830114543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 673px;","style":"width: 663px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"青麸杨 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/青麸杨 7-20240830111400-p1dz3qj.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 663px;\" parent-style=\"width: 673px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 610px;","style":"width: 600px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"青麸杨 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/青麸杨 11-20240830114540-yddn92a.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 600px;\" parent-style=\"width: 610px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240830110350-eiuvtv4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830110350-eiuvtv4","updated":"20240830114553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"青麸杨"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/青麸杨-20240830104309-1r7yopa.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240830110843-szt12ol","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830110843-szt12ol","updated":"20240830110843"}},{"ID":"20240830110843-w0qxbs8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830110843-w0qxbs8","updated":"20240830113027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"青麸杨和盐肤木区别"}]},{"ID":"20240830111935-oz36m8x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830111935-oz36m8x","updated":"20240830113021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"青麸杨、盐肤木对比"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/青麸杨、盐肤木对比-20240830111935-39teuri.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240830111307-ns54l49","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830111307-ns54l49","updated":"20240830111836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（上图中，左为青麸杨，右为盐肤木；盐肤木右叶托，青麸杨没有；）"}]},{"ID":"20240830111317-qstfser","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830111317-qstfser","updated":"20240830111757"}},{"ID":"20240830110502-mli2wy0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830110502-mli2wy0","updated":"20240830111043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：青麸杨跟盐肤木外形相似，且都属于世界上最咸的植物之一；"}]},{"ID":"20240830110924-vw5dcn3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830110924-vw5dcn3","updated":"20240830110930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"二注：青麸杨的果实会挂满白霜，这个白霜正是青麸杨产出的盐巴（青麸杨生长时会吸收土壤里面的盐分，到夏天的时候就会发汗，发完汗以后就会结出这种白霜）；"}]},{"ID":"20240830110352-v9vkuii","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240830110352-v9vkuii"}},{"ID":"20240903091307-zgdhgy6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-zgdhgy6","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：青麸杨根"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-c005xyi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-c005xyi","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"青麸杨根《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-1nx76p8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-1nx76p8","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《重庆草药》"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-cobe7il","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-cobe7il","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】QīnɡFūYánɡGēn"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-0et7x7d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-0et7x7d","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为漆树科植物青麸杨的树根。9～10月采收。"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-tpuyole","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-tpuyole","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-a17k8xb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-a17k8xb","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"青麸杨，又名：波氏盐肤木，铁倍树。"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-mhktyue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-mhktyue","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"落叶乔木，高5～8米。树皮粗糙，灰色，有裂缝，小枝通常平滑无毛。单数羽状复叶，互生，具小叶7～9枚，每叶有极短而明显的柄，小叶卵状长圆形至长圆状披针形，长5～10厘米，宽2～4厘米，先端渐尖，基部斜楔形或圆形，全缘，背面沿叶脉处微有细毛或近于无毛；叶轴圆柱形，有时在上部的小叶片间有狭翅。圆锥花序顶生，长10～20厘米，有微毛；花小；萼片5，宿存；花瓣5，白色；雄蕊5，花药黄色；雌蕊1，子房上位，花柱3裂。果序下垂，核果近球形，直径3～4毫米，血红色，密被绒毛，内含一粒种子。花期5～6月。果期9月。"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-8r1c9dr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-8r1c9dr","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】喜生于向阳山坡、山谷的疏林或灌木草丛中。分布河北、山西、陕西、甘肃、四川、贵州、河南、湖北、湖南、江西、浙江、福建等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-zyy7sb4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-zyy7sb4","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】味辛，性热，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-kmy4i4p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-kmy4i4p","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】去风解毒。治小儿缩阴症，九子烂痒。"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-v0nxomv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-v0nxomv","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-gyiabpj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-gyiabpj","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治小儿缩阴症：青麸杨根一两，去粗皮，煎水煮捞糟服。"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-e4l8u33","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-e4l8u33","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治九子烂痒：青麸杨根二两，一味药二两，何首乌二两，肉连环二两。炖杀口肉吃。（性味以下出《重庆草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-qiyl5fy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-qiyl5fy","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【备注】本品在四川民间，与盐肤木的根同等使用。参见\"盐麸子根\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-sh9kujg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-sh9kujg","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-aznje2t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-aznje2t","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"青麸杨根《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-qukbaxk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-qukbaxk","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《重庆草药》。"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-l5zzfn8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-l5zzfn8","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】QīnɡFūYánɡGēn"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-4dcsgjt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-4dcsgjt","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】RootofPotaninSumac"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-hdfnq4d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-hdfnq4d","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】青麸杨、波氏盐肤木、铁倍树。"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-i2jrd5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-i2jrd5e","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-ygmlq86","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-ygmlq86","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为漆树科植物青麸杨的根。"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-rpz7mgp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-rpz7mgp","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：RhuspotaniniiMaxim."}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-1k7tqhe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-1k7tqhe","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：夏、秋季采挖，洗净，除去表皮，留取韧皮部，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-afced57","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-afced57","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】青麸杨落叶乔木，高5-8m。树皮灰褐色，小枝无毛。奇数羽状复叶互生，叶轴圆筒形，有时在上部的小叶间有狭翅；小叶7-11，具短柄；小叶卵状长圆形或长圆状披针形，长5-10cm，宽2-4cm，先端渐尖，基部多少偏斜，近圆形，全缘，两面沿中脉被微柔毛或近无毛。圆锥花序顶生，长10-20cm，被微柔毛；苞片钻形，长约1mm，被微柔毛；花白色，径2.5-3mm；花梗长约1mm、被微柔毛；花萼外面被微柔毛，裂片卵形，长约1mm，两面被微柔毛，边缘具细睫毛，开花时先端外卷；花丝线形，长约2mm，在雌花中较短，花药卵形；花盘厚，无毛；子房球形，径约0.7mm，密被白色柔毛。果序下垂；核果近球形，直径3-4mm，密被具节柔毛和腺毛，成熟时红色；内含种子1颗。"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-hupnatl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-hupnatl","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-lr8foip","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-lr8foip","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于海拔900-2500m的山坡疏林或灌丛中。"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-hlczvto","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-hlczvto","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于山西、陕西、甘肃、河南、湖北、四川、云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-i51furn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-i51furn","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】本品在四川民间，与盐肤木BhuschinensisMill.的根同等使用。参见盐麸子根条。"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-a37a91l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-a37a91l","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】辛；热"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-xcqvvdp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-xcqvvdp","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】心；肝；肾经"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-0pmhyl2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-0pmhyl2","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】祛风解毒。主小儿缩阴症；瘰疬"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-tr3t5ym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-tr3t5ym","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，30-60g。"}]},{"ID":"20240903091307-mg2xggr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091307-mg2xggr","updated":"20240903091312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240903091308-jd7uwd2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240903091308-jd7uwd2","updated":"20240903091312"}},{"ID":"20240903091309-ow9hcxm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091309-ow9hcxm","updated":"20240903091312"}}]}